Tue Aug 11 03:21:16 PM MDT 2026
Dataman 4.0.0
server -
    - changed the entire indexing system to use copy on write.  Tightened
	up compiler issues due to more modern compilers.  Various timing
	and locking bugs.
client -
    - lots of changes to handle new indexing, improve error handling,
	other things that have been bugging me for years. Not a re-
	write of the libs, but all of them were affected.
overall -
    - this  has been a -long- time since I've worked on this.  it seemed
	to me it was time to re-visit it and see if there was any value
	to keeping it updated.  Hardware has gotten cheaper and faster.
	but this should still be ideal for smaller systems.
      - released as 4.0.0


