Fri Sep 25 14:41:12 MDT 2009
Dataman 3.3.6
server -
	- fixed a bug left over from removing references to the free list.
	- fixed a bug in upd_idx to do more checking for the rec format.

client -
	- made changes to make the c++ client lib more robust.  This stemmed
	  from having the database functionality in a plug-in library.  So
	  closing and re-opening the connections on load and re-load of the
	  lib works better.
	- changed the Makefile.ac files so library numbers are no longer tied
	  to program release numbers.  this makes it so you can update the
	  libs without having to re-link your applications.

overall -
	- released ase 3.3.6


Tue Jul 28 12:39:07 MDT 2009
Dataman 3.3.5
server -
	- fixed a small but nasty bug in node_search.  when you built an index
	  with MAX_KEYLEN key length would overflow a buffer.  another bug in
	  the recv_from_server, that would show up sometimes as well.

