Sat Oct 21 09:53:58 MDT 2006
Dataman 3.3.1
server -
	Minor changes for very odd bugs.
client -
	Big changes for c++ library.  Dropped the ".field" way to
	reference a field, ie master.field[n], has become just
	master[n].  This is more consistent with the c library and
	allows for array bounds checking.  Added a new overloaded
	operator to return a field as a const char *.  Remember
	precedence rules!
overall -
	updated the docs to reflect the changes.  Released 3.3.1.


